{"id": "success-center-youthbuild-shared-costs", "title": "A roster check led Success Center to remove charges from its YouthBuild grant", "seconds": 63.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "4d4688293c9fbe8e", "words": 176, "beats": [{"scene": "roster", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At Success Center, a federal grant paid for services tied to individual young people.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.71, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "grant", "should", "pay?"], "sub": "YouthBuild participant costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.6, 1.01, 1.17, 1.56, 1.87, 2.14, 2.31, 2.85, 3.22, 3.36, 3.91, 4.14]}, {"scene": "roster", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Federal monitors asked which participants were enrolled in YouthBuild.", "t0": 4.83, "t1": 8.58, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit23", "kicker": "Centers for Equity and Success / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "YouthBuild participant roster", "mark": "YouthBuild participant roster"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.92, 1.23, 1.48, 2.17, 2.35, 2.73, 2.86]}, {"scene": "roster", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They questioned 5,560 dollars in supportive service costs.", "t0": 8.7, "t1": 13.01, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,560", "label": "Participant support costs questioned"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.7, 1.0, 1.48, 1.71, 1.98, 2.31, 2.73, 2.87, 3.31, 3.65]}, {"scene": "roster", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The enrollment roster could show which costs belonged on the federal grant.", "t0": 13.13, "t1": 16.83, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Who received the services?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.63, 0.99, 1.21, 1.55, 1.78, 2.28, 2.68, 2.76, 2.87, 3.21]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "YouthBuild and City youth programs shared an address at 1245 Howard Street.", "t0": 17.05, "t1": 21.61, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "1245 Howard Street", "heading": "Programs at the same site", "source": "audit23", "rows": [{"icon": "building", "label": "YouthBuild", "value": "Federal grant"}, {"icon": "cityhall", "label": "City youth programs", "value": "Shared site"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.61, 0.79, 1.06, 1.26, 1.82, 2.12, 2.22, 2.68, 2.84, 3.17, 3.7, 4.0]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Success Center described a separate way to allocate rent, using floor space.", "t0": 21.73, "t1": 26.37, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit23", "kicker": "Centers for Equity and Success / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "Floor plan", "mark": "Floor plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.87, 1.43, 1.57, 1.93, 2.15, 2.26, 2.72, 3.55, 3.89, 4.18]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "As programs moved in or out, the center could update each program’s share.", "t0": 26.49, "t1": 30.59, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The rent allocation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.68, 0.97, 1.11, 1.25, 1.95, 2.13, 2.45, 2.64, 3.01, 3.22, 3.71]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The center said it removed ineligible participant costs from its December 2023 report.", "t0": 30.71, "t1": 35.82, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit23", "kicker": "Centers for Equity and Success / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "December 2023 correction", "mark": "December 2023 correction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.48, 0.68, 0.78, 1.18, 1.79, 2.36, 2.79, 3.0, 3.17, 3.62, 3.86, 4.47]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "It compared its books with the participant roster and supplied a journal entry.", "t0": 35.94, "t1": 39.83, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Accounting records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.58, 0.76, 1.2, 1.42, 1.52, 2.12, 2.51, 2.65, 3.06, 3.15, 3.51]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City ledger lists four youth department contracts with the organization in fiscal 2023.", "t0": 39.95, "t1": 45.16, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "city", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "Fiscal 2023 City ledger", "mark": "Fiscal 2023 City ledger"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.87, 1.2, 1.53, 1.76, 2.24, 2.78, 2.93, 3.04, 3.67, 3.79, 4.23, 4.57]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The review also raised concerns about training hours, eligibility records, staffing and purchasing.", "t0": 45.28, "t1": 50.64, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Other monitoring findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.56, 0.87, 1.13, 1.59, 1.82, 2.22, 2.87, 3.53, 4.21, 4.69, 4.81]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next audit recorded the Labor Department’s July 2024 closure of all nine findings.", "t0": 50.76, "t1": 56.48, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit24", "kicker": "Centers for Equity and Success / independent auditor", "text": "July 2024 closure letter", "mark": "July 2024 closure letter"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 1.29, 1.78, 1.89, 2.15, 2.69, 3.1, 3.41, 3.98, 4.46, 4.6, 4.81, 5.1]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not establish that a City grant paid those costs.", "t0": 56.6, "t1": 60.08, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["City grant charge", "Cash repayment"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.53, 0.69, 0.86, 1.41, 1.57, 1.68, 1.95, 2.29, 2.58, 2.81]}, {"scene": "address", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 60.2, "t1": 62.57, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"roster": "Who was enrolled?", "address": "Programs at one address"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "question"}